The '''Dank Depths''' is one of the environments in [[chapter 3]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]''. The theme of the Dank Depths is tar, which can be found dripping from the ceiling and bubbling in pits. {{dlc|nr}} Rocks have a chance to be replaced with [[spikes]].

The Dank Depths' alternate floors are the {{s|Depths}} and {{s|Necropolis}}. The boss of the Dank Depths II is always {{e|Mom}}.

{{dlc+|r}} After {{a|A Secret Exit}} is unlocked, a door will appear in Dank Depths I's {{r|Boss Room}} upon defeating the boss, leading to the {{S|Mausoleum}} / {{S|Gehenna}}. This door requires two hearts to be opened (except on Lost characters). Unlike {{r|Angel Room}}s and {{r|Devil Room}}s, this door never disappears. Also after this achievement is unlocked, [[a Strange Door]] in the starting room of Dank Depths II will appear. This door leads to {{S|Mausoleum}} / {{S|Gehenna}} II before entering the [[Ascent]].
{{dlc-}}

{{dlc|a+}} The Dank Depths are unlocked by defeating {{e|It Lives!}} 21 times.
* Killing {{e|Dogma}} and {{e|The Beast}} also increases this tally, as does [[Mausoleum]]'s version of Mom's Heart.

