== Trivia ==
* Due to the Dank versions of enemies being more common on this type of floor, it may be the hardest of the other Chapter 3 floors.
* Edmund McMillen confirmed that the Dank Depths is made up of [https://twitter.com/edmundmcmillen/status/1487547451145801731 black mold, ichor, and tar].

== Music ==
* The [[music]] in the Dank Depths is titled "Pulso Profundum."<ref>[https://ridiculon.bandcamp.com/album/the-binding-of-isaac-afterbirth-ost Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth OST]</ref>

